[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6973.47, "timestamp": "01:56:13", "text": "来るよ。彼は肉を手に入れた。彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6976.35, "timestamp": "01:56:16", "text": "肉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6979.669, "timestamp": "01:56:19", "text": "なぜ？何てことだ。彼は肉を手に入れた。何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7014.95, "timestamp": "01:56:54", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7018.07, "timestamp": "01:56:58", "text": "だから、この食べ物はあなたには良いし、はい"}]